<title>SRI LANKA: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lankan ports, Nov 11 - Colombo - 12 container dischargers/loaders, seven food dischargers, one gas discharger, five general cargo dischargers and one general cargo loader presently working in port. Five food dischargers, one steel discharger, two general cargo dischargers and one fertiliser discharger awaiting berth. Berthing delay for feeder vessels approximately 24-48 hrs.</p>
</text>
